  "text": "Our new English teacher is Mr James Taylor. He is 34 years old and he is from Manchester, in England. He lives in Wrocław with his wife, Agata, and their small daughter, Lily. James speaks English, French and a little Polish. He teaches adults and teenagers. His lessons are on Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays. In his free time, James plays the guitar and goes cycling. He loves Polish food, especially pierogi, but he doesn't like coffee. He drinks tea every day!",
